DESCRIPTION:The VRTO Spatial Media World Conference - presented in partner
 ship with OCAD University - returns June 24 to 26\, 2026.\n\nNow in its 11
 th year\, the VRTO Spatial Media World Conference - presented in partnersh
 ip with OCAD University - returns June 24 to 26\, 2026\, at 100 McCaul St.
  to celebrate the creative and cultural potential of immersive technologie
 s. This year’s gathering invites technologists\, storytellers\, and syst
 ems thinkers to explore how XR can transform not only experiences\, but th
 e infrastructures of connection\, equity and imagination. Check for ticket
  and programming info: https://conference.virtualreality.to/
LOCATION:Main Building & Rosalie Sharp Centre for Design (MCA) 100 McCaul 
 Street
